Hello all; 

Critiquing the headline 

Trudeau denies he was lied to by his ministers regarding this fundraising rules breach, but says he’s ‘open’ to his ministers starting to follow them (fundraising rules) as reforms.

Why does Mr. Trudeau need to lie about this?  Who is he protecting from the truth?  Maybe himself?  Could it be that sunny ways aren't working anymore, not even with his own cabinet  ministers?

In closing, best wishes and best regards to all;

Mr. Brian Leslie Engler

